---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Manifesto — The False Creator">
  <main class="page">
    <a href="/" class="back">← THE FALSE CREATOR</a>
    <p class="eyebrow">01 / THE THESIS</p>
    <h1>The world<br />is <em>not finished.</em></h1>
    <p class="lead">A manifesto for curiosity, careful doubt, and the courage to make things that do not yet exist.</p>
    <p>Not every limit is a wall. Some are assumptions that have stood long enough to look like laws. The work begins by learning which is which.</p>
    <p>Creation is not proof that anything is possible. It is the disciplined act of discovering what is possible, what is not, and where the boundary moves when we try.</p>
    <a class="back" href="/#worlds">← RETURN TO THE WORLDS</a>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .page { max-width: 900px; min-height: 100vh; margin: auto; padding: 3rem 1.5rem 8rem; }
  .back,.eyebrow { font: 10px 'DM Mono',monospace; letter-spacing: .12em; color: #a7a49c; }
  .eyebrow { margin-top: 8rem; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 9rem); letter-spacing: -.08em; line-height: .9; font-weight: 500; margin: 2rem 0; }
  h1 em { color: #d6c8a8; font-style: normal; }
  p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 650px; color: #b6b3ab; font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.9; }
  .lead { font-size: 1.4rem !important; color: #edeae2 !important; }
</style>
